OL,3,GNEWSAReport on 'overly ambitious' i360 
OL,4,Aplan to be debated                     
OL,6,FA long-awaited report into Brighton and
OL,7,FHove City Council's loan to the i360 is
OL,8,Fdue to go before councillors.          
OL,10,FThe Chartered Institute of Public      
OL,11,FFinance and Accountancy report found   
OL,12,Fthe council had been presented with    
OL,13,F"overly ambitious" financial and       
OL,14,Fvisitor number projections.            
OL,16,FRecommendations for future projects    
OL,17,Finclude applying optimism bias         
OL,18,Fadjustments, modelling best-case and   
OL,19,Fworst-case scenarios, using multiple   
OL,20,Fsources to validate demand and pricing,
OL,21,Fand using data and social media        
OL,22,Fanalysis to gauge market appetite.     
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
